WEBVTT

00:12:29.953 --> 00:12:30.954
(Laughter)

00:12:31.705 --> 00:12:34.833
But it’s also incredibly
lonely and isolating,

00:12:34.833 --> 00:12:36.919
and I didn’t want to live
that life anymore.

00:12:36.919 --> 00:12:38.629
And so I decided to change my life.

00:12:38.879 --> 00:12:40.506
And I left all of that alone.

00:12:40.589 --> 00:12:43.467
I really did, like, just change my spirit.

00:12:43.801 --> 00:12:46.345
And leaving fashion obviously helped.

00:12:47.221 --> 00:12:49.014
And when I did that,

00:12:49.014 --> 00:12:52.518
all of a sudden, I let
Little Brown Bevy out to play.

00:12:53.894 --> 00:12:54.978
Little Brown Bevy.

00:12:56.647 --> 00:12:57.815
I love her so much.

00:12:58.273 --> 00:13:00.692
Little Brown Bevy is a nerdy girl,